    "overview": "This record covers the inherited AI26 dark application shell and the Camera settings extension. It describes the current implementation, not a replacement identity or a universal redesign. Godseye is outside this record. PRODUCT.md is absent; a creative North Star, brand adjectives, anti-references, and qualitative component philosophy are unrecorded.\n\nThe implemented surface uses black backgrounds, zinc controls and dividers, white text and primary actions, and teal focus and status treatments. Native labelled metadata fields sit beside retained revision history on desktop and above it on mobile. Screenshots show an internally scrolling section beneath the application header.",
